<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-086-C habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.422582" lon="-120.972767"><name>SC26-086-C</name><cmt>SC26-086</cmt><desc>Point Estero rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 4.6 m relief across 210 m. Terrain C 51/100; not catch probability. Center 143 ft; nearby 140–157 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Parallel bands visible in survey rendering; confirm small-scale relief by sonar. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9ZSTUK1"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-067</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.424974157513375" lon="-120.97298235847693"/><trkpt lat="35.42470382305059" lon="-120.97298913398106"/><trkpt lat="35.424698276718786" lon="-120.97265886363859"/><trkpt lat="35.424427942297804" lon="-120.97266564015466"/><trkpt lat="35.424328585051725" lon="-120.97211745105216"/><trkpt lat="35.42405825070489" lon="-120.97212422928467"/><trkpt lat="35.42406749638257" lon="-120.972674675369"/><trkpt lat="35.42370705044378" lon="-120.97268371042294"/><trkpt lat="35.42371259657367" lon="-120.97301397672443"/><trkpt lat="35.42236831688692" lon="-120.97348819910016"/><trkpt lat="35.42246951507083" lon="-120.97414646418767"/><trkpt lat="35.42228929189231" lon="-120.97415097819025"/><trkpt lat="35.42229668092607" lon="-120.97459132596342